{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hi everyone! This is a casual puzzle game that simulates a claw machine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you can experience a relaxing time. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move the joystick to press the button and collect the plush toys!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941350/extras/6f266800ceba98c160f73a76b95a5f2f.poster.avif?t=1768036693\" width=480 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941350/extras/6f266800ceba98c160f73a76b95a5f2f.webm?t=1768036693\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941350/extras/6f266800ceba98c160f73a76b95a5f2f.mp4?t=1768036693\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>The first 15 are fixed rewards in the level, the remaining need to be obtained through random catch in free mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The acquired dolls can be viewed on the collection shelf. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are a total of 10 levels, with a total of 30 cute dolls of the same style waiting for you to acquire!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941350/extras/cd10712fe33874adc8782826dc94d155.poster.avif?t=1768036693\" width=480 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941350/extras/cd10712fe33874adc8782826dc94d155.webm?t=1768036693\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941350/extras/cd10712fe33874adc8782826dc94d155.mp4?t=1768036693\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Operation guide/manual</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move the grabbing claw by using the buttons or joysticks on the machine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Position and adjust to move the claw to a suitable position so that it can clamp the target object when grabbing it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the claw is in the ideal position, press the button, and the claw will descend and try to clamp the target object.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once the target object is clamped, the claw will start to rise, bringing the object out of the claw machine to get the doll.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941350/extras/d0496207c94a938ef4645201f08775f3.poster.avif?t=1768036693\" width=480 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941350/extras/d0496207c94a938ef4645201f08775f3.webm?t=1768036693\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941350/extras/d0496207c94a938ef4645201f08775f3.mp4?t=1768036693\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game difficulty is casual level, which is suitable for players who do not want to spend too much effort to pass the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I hope everyone will like this game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After clearing customs, you can experience various exquisite character illustrations as a reward.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Start the game.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2941350/5e7e732f1026bd9d221c638fa7c3095fa90482e7.jpg"},{"name":"Meeting the kitty for the first time, so cute!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2941350/20c5cfcbd517ffe2a6aed5d5f615a2502e1232f2.jpg"},{"name":"Kitty!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2941350/c24f5cf978d1b999610b88b54c88d70766587699.jpg"},{"name":"Haha, that is too easy!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2941350/5cb3d8192679443810fc29ffe8788f0b7d9cb1a6.jpg"},{"name":"Come on up, little kitty~","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2941350/6272efe221b3db7ddd314d3fad21a21b534193f7.jpg"},{"name":"You can't escape me, little kitty.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2941350/4f7b5fbaae20c3384469a29d6a84ea4163ea21e1.jpg"},{"name":"Unlock a new kitty.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2941350/19f224923d2d398b7635ac792eb8b0f81e2d743e.jpg"},{"name":"Got it easily.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2941350/44eeb006224d05b3675e5f1594e9a028d34eb7cd.jpg"},{"name":"The third to last level is not difficult at all.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2941350/ce9c0bea5db0182a0632a555eb83664233b8e401.jpg"},{"name":"The second to last level is not difficult at all.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2941350/570bba203732dfd8ec5dd789ff4a77441b7828d7.jpg"}],"total":41},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2941350?t=1768036693","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941350/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768036693","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941350/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768036693","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941350/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768036693","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":"This Game may contain content not appropriate for all ages, or may not be appropriate for viewing at work: Sexual Content, General Mature Content\r\n\r\nAll characters involved in sexual content are over the age of 18."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hi everyone! This is a casual puzzle game that simulates a claw machine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you can experience a relaxing time. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move the joystick to press the button and collect the plush toys!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941350/extras/6f266800ceba98c160f73a76b95a5f2f.poster.avif?t=1768036693\" width=480 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941350/extras/6f266800ceba98c160f73a76b95a5f2f.webm?t=1768036693\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941350/extras/6f266800ceba98c160f73a76b95a5f2f.mp4?t=1768036693\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>The first 15 are fixed rewards in the level, the remaining need to be obtained through random catch in free mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The acquired dolls can be viewed on the collection shelf. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are a total of 10 levels, with a total of 30 cute dolls of the same style waiting for you to acquire!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941350/extras/cd10712fe33874adc8782826dc94d155.poster.avif?t=1768036693\" width=480 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941350/extras/cd10712fe33874adc8782826dc94d155.webm?t=1768036693\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941350/extras/cd10712fe33874adc8782826dc94d155.mp4?t=1768036693\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Operation guide/manual</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move the grabbing claw by using the buttons or joysticks on the machine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Position and adjust to move the claw to a suitable position so that it can clamp the target object when grabbing it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the claw is in the ideal position, press the button, and the claw will descend and try to clamp the target object.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once the target object is clamped, the claw will start to rise, bringing the object out of the claw machine to get the doll.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941350/extras/d0496207c94a938ef4645201f08775f3.poster.avif?t=1768036693\" width=480 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941350/extras/d0496207c94a938ef4645201f08775f3.webm?t=1768036693\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941350/extras/d0496207c94a938ef4645201f08775f3.mp4?t=1768036693\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game difficulty is casual level, which is suitable for players who do not want to spend too much effort to pass the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I hope everyone will like this game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After clearing customs, you can experience various exquisite character illustrations as a reward.</p>","developers":["No.25"],"dlc":[2965240],"genres"